        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lee Min-ho, Jun Ji-hyun\n- Products: Gangnam Blues, Bounty Hunters, The Legend of the Blue Sea\n- Places: Seoul, Gangnam district\n- Topics: South Korean film and television, China-produced film, 1970s real estate development\n\nFacts:\n- In 2015, Lee Min-ho starred in his first leading film role in Gangnam Blues.\n- Gangnam Blues is set in the 1970s during the real estate development of Seoul's Gangnam district amid socio-political turmoil and terrorism.\n- In 2016, Lee Min-ho appeared in Bounty Hunters, his first China-produced film.\n- The Legend of the Blue Sea is a 2016–2017 South Korean television series starring Jun Ji-hyun and Lee Min-ho.",
